<h2>The Impact</h2>
<p>
  At peak hours, Mountain Dew tournaments accounted for 67% of all Halo Infinite
  viewership on Twitch. The series earned 2.2M+ views on X, 740K+ on YouTube, and 438K+ on Twitch, and the Community Gauntlet format was so popular that 343
  Industries added it to Halo's map playlist.
</p>

